---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — Qplot" lang="en">
  <div class="bg-brand-light min-h-screen py-24 px-6 md:px-10">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <a href="/en" class="text-brand-accent text-sm font-heading font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase hover:underline mb-10 block">← Back to home</a>

      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-brand mb-2">Privacy Notice</h1>
      <p class="text-brand/40 text-sm mb-12">Effective date: 2026-04-07</p>

      <div class="prose prose-brand space-y-10 text-brand/80 leading-relaxed">

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-brand mb-3">1. Details of the data controller</h2>
          <p>Name of the data controller: <strong>Studio Qvarta Kft</strong></p>
          <p>Registered office: 1029 Budapest, Zsolt fejedelem u. 85.</p>
          <p>Email: <a href="mailto:office@qvarta.eu" class="text-brand-accent hover:underline">office@qvarta.eu</a></p>
          <p>Phone number: <a href="tel:+36304446003" class="text-brand-accent hover:underline">+36 30 444 6003</a></p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-brand mb-3">2. Categories of personal data processed</h2>
          <p>When using the website, the following personal data are processed:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li>Email address</li>
            <li>Phone number</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-brand mb-3">3. Purpose of data processing</h2>
          <p>Personal data are processed for the following purposes:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li>Enabling contact</li>
            <li>Maintaining customer relations</li>
            <li>Responding to inquiries</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-brand mb-3">4. Legal basis for data processing</h2>
          <p>The legal basis for data processing is the data subject's voluntary consent pursuant to Article 6(1)(a) of the GDPR.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-brand mb-3">5. Duration of data storage</h2>
          <p>Personal data are processed for as long as the purpose of the processing exists, or until the data subject withdraws their consent, but for no longer than 5 years.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-brand mb-3">6. Data processors</h2>
          <p>During the operation of the service, the data controller may use data processors (for example, a hosting provider), who process personal data solely on the basis of the instructions of the data controller.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-brand mb-3">7. Access to the data</h2>
          <p>Personal data are accessible exclusively to the data controller and are not transferred to third parties, except where required by law.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-brand mb-3">8. Rights of data subjects</h2>
          <p>The data subject has the right to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li>Request information about the processing of their personal data</li>
            <li>Request the rectification of their data</li>
            <li>Request the erasure of their data</li>
            <li>Request the restriction of data processing</li>
            <li>Object to data processing</li>
            <li>Withdraw their consent at any time</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-brand mb-3">9. Legal remedies</h2>
          <p>If you believe that the processing of your personal data violates applicable laws, you may lodge a complaint with the Hungarian National Authority for Data Protection and Freedom of Information (NAIH), or turn to a court.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-brand mb-3">10. Data security</h2>
          <p>The data controller shall ensure the security of personal data by implementing appropriate technical and organizational measures.</p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
